Forwarding the full Heartland thread from last spring for the H&V data room, per Evan's request at scoping. Bottom of the thread is the debrief Robert Enloe sent me after the award decision; it is the customer's own words and I would treat it as the definitive account of why we lost. I know a different version of this story circulates internally. The version below is the one the customer wrote down.

